=== SUMMARY ===
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data sources : RedisSignalViewerPageViewModel binds shared S8 VehiclesStore.vehicles() (web useVehicles) for the picker, plus the
               redis dev-tools reads/mutations over the resilient ApiHttpClient via RedisSignalViewerSource (redisSignalViewerSource):
               GET /dev-tools/redis-signals?vehicle_id (web getRedisSignals), GET /dev-tools/redis-signals/keys (web getRedisSignalKeys,
               for the diagnostic "other vehicles" chips), DELETE /dev-tools/redis-signals?vehicle_id (web purgeRedisSignals),
               DELETE /dev-tools/redis-signals/keys (web purgeAllRedisSignals). JSON->rows/meta/keys projection in RedisSignalViewerPageModel;
               no HTTP in the view. The single redisFeed collection yields BOTH the UiState and the DiagnosticError (no second fetch).
si/units     : Redis cache payload carries no unit-bearing fields (signal names, raw values, type/category enums, ISO timestamps, meta
               counts) — round-trips verbatim, no SI conversion; location values masked by default via MaskedValue (click-to-reveal).
a11y/theme   : >=48dp Material targets; destructive buttons carry Modifier.semantics content descriptions (purge*ButtonTitle); EmptyState
               content descriptions; dynamic-color + dark theme via MaterialTheme (A2 tokens); Compose-native only (no webview).
nav          : Destinations 'redisSignals' -> /redis-signals (pre-existing) wired to RedisSignalViewerRoute() via PageHosts.register;
               deep link auto-registered by the NavHost. RouteTableTest already enumerates /redis-signals -> redisSignals (green).
